; The BODY with no scripts on it -- the far tier of the ambient crowd (PedCrowd, PLAN.md 3.6d).
; It exists only to state the armature's 180-degree turn: a VRoid export faces +Z while the game
; faces -Z (W41, "the armature's frame is not the game's"), and a crowd that writes walk transforms
; onto an unturned body walks backwards. CharacterVisuals_Shino.tscn states the same turn for the
; playable body; this is the same fact with nothing else attached.

